        "TileImage": "$($repository 9454339d-8f29-4ae6-97f4-96523a48bf08).Image",
        "Description": "47, I&apos;ve picked up something interesting. Two militia&apos;s under Senator Jojo Yani&apos;s have gathered on Ambrose Island. They hold ICA Agent Smith from Chonqing captive. Free him, 47 (for RP). Smith believes Orson Mills, Jojo&apos;s close friend, is the Senator of the party. But Jojo himself is disquised as another prisoner to get information from Smith. You will have to eliminate Senator Yani and his associate Orson Mills. Be aware, 47, Jojo is actually a strategical mastermind. \rGood luck, 47.",
